{
  "name": "03 · Motor de seguimientos",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "f03-note",
      "name": "Nota: qué falta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-260, -380],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 700,
        "height": 340,
        "content": "## 03 · Motor de seguimientos (borrador)\nEspec: docs/06 fila 03 y docs/07 (Envío). Anti-bloqueo (regla dura 4): horario hábil, 45–90 s entre envíos, tope diario, mensajes personalizados.\n\n**Falta:**\n- RPC `claim_due_followups(max)`: toma los `followups` pendientes con `scheduled_at <= now()`, les pone `job_id` en la misma transacción (idempotencia), descuenta el tope diario y devuelve teléfono/correo del contacto, texto ya renderizado con firma y modo. No existe.\n- Leer `horario_habil`, `tope_envios_dia` y `separacion_envios_seg` de `configuration` (aquí van fijos en el código).\n- Guardar el saliente en `wa_messages` con el `wa_message_id` que devuelve Evolution antes del eco del webhook (si no, se duplica; ver aprendizajes T9) y el correo en `emails`.\n- Variables `SUPABASE_URL`, `EVOLUTION_URL`, `EVOLUTION_INSTANCE` en el entorno de n8n.\n- Remitente SMTP por ejecutivo (`sales_mail_accounts`, Fase 5): hoy usa una sola credencial.\n- Ramificar por `channels` del seguimiento: el borrador manda por WhatsApp y correo siempre."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f03-trigger",
      "name": "Cada 15 min",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [-260, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": { "interval": [{ "field": "minutes", "minutesInterval": 15 }] }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f03-hours",
      "name": "Solo en horario hábil",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-40, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ponytail: fixed Mon–Fri 09:00–18:00 America/Santiago until configuration.horario_habil is read.\nconst now = $now.setZone('America/Santiago');\nconst isBusinessHours = now.weekday <= 5 && now.hour >= 9 && now.hour < 18;\nreturn isBusinessHours ? [{ json: { now: now.toISO() } }] : [];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f03-claim",
      "name": "Tomar seguimientos vencidos (RPC pendiente)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [180, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}/rest/v1/rpc/claim_due_followups",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "supabaseApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ max: 20 }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": { "name": "Supabase service role" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f03-mode",
      "name": "¿Automático?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [400, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "f03-mode-cond",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.mode }}",
              "rightValue": "automatico",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f03-loop",
      "name": "Uno por uno",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [620, -120],
      "parameters": { "batchSize": 1, "options": {} }
    },
    {
      "id": "f03-wait",
      "name": "Separación 45–90 s",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [840, -120],
      "webhookId": "7c1d2a10-0003-4a6e-9b1f-03a1b2c3d403",
      "parameters": {
        "amount": "={{ 45 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 46) }}",
        "unit": "seconds"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f03-wa",
      "name": "Enviar WhatsApp (Evolution)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1060, -120],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.EVOLUTION_URL }}/message/sendText/{{ $env.EVOLUTION_INSTANCE }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ number: $json.phone, text: $json.whatsapp_text }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": { "name": "Evolution API key" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f03-mail",
      "name": "Enviar correo (SMTP)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1280, -120],
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $('Uno por uno').item.json.sales_email }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $('Uno por uno').item.json.contact_email }}",
        "subject": "={{ $('Uno por uno').item.json.email_subject }}",
        "emailFormat": "text",
        "text": "={{ $('Uno por uno').item.json.email_text }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": { "name": "SMTP TekFusion" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f03-sent",
      "name": "Marcar enviado",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1500, -120],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}/rest/v1/followups?id=eq.{{ $('Uno por uno').item.json.id }}&status=eq.pendiente",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "supabaseApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ status: 'enviado', sent_at: $now.toUTC().toISO() }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": { "name": "Supabase service role" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f03-reminder",
      "name": "Alerta al ejecutivo (recordatorio)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [620, 120],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}/rest/v1/alerts",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "supabaseApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ type: 'seguimiento_vencido', recipient_sales_id: $json.sales_id, deal_id: $json.deal_id, message: 'Seguimiento pendiente: ' + $json.deal_name }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": { "name": "Supabase service role" }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
